        263.2849426269531,
        84.57283782958984
      ],
      "text": "5.1.3 Children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        91.27869415283203,
        527.59814453125,
        105.72169494628906
      ],
      "text": "The GDG considered data on using mWRDs for screening children and adolescent outpatients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        104.47870635986328,
        527.3805541992188,
        118.92170715332031
      ],
      "text": "accessing health care. They felt that the data, which included 2 studies with 787 participants and had",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        117.67871856689453,
        527.5918579101562,
        132.12171936035156
      ],
      "text": "results demonstrating substantial heterogeneity, represented insufficient evidence to establish an",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        130.8787384033203,
        527.55517578125,
        145.3217315673828
      ],
      "text": "accurate and reliable estimate of the diagnostic accuracy of mWRDs, and, thus, the GDG decided not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992597579956055,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.07875061035156,
        527.4136962890625,
        158.52174377441406
      ],
      "text": "to issue a recommendation for or against their use as a screening tool for children and adolescents.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.27870178222656,
        527.3905639648438,
        171.72169494628906
      ],
      "text": "This highlights as a research priority the need for more rigorous studies evaluating the use of mWRDs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986842155456543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.4788360595703,
        252.54653930664062,
        184.9218292236328
      ],
      "text": "for screening children and adolescents.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        192.1826934814453,
        527.1435546875,
        206.6256866455078
      ],
      "text": "Also highlighted is the urgent overall need for more research and the development of better screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962084770202637,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.38270568847656,
        527.3750610351562,
        219.82569885253906
      ],
      "text": "tools and approaches for use in this population, including more data on screening approaches that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.5827178955078,
        527.389404296875,
        233.0257110595703
      ],
      "text": "target specific and distinct age ranges including infants younger than 12 months, children younger",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        231.78273010253906,
        527.376953125,
        246.22572326660156
      ],
      "text": "than 5 years, children up to the age of 10 years and those aged 10–19 years. More data are needed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        244.9827423095703,
        527.415771484375,
        259.4257507324219
      ],
      "text": "to determine the frequency with which screening should be conducted among the subpopulations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.18267822265625,
        527.4080200195312,
        272.6257019042969
      ],
      "text": "of children at highest risk of TB, and further research is needed from well-designed clinical trials to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        271.3826904296875,
        426.8656005859375,
        285.8257141113281
      ],
      "text": "provide evidence on patient-important outcomes for TB screening in children.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.81402587890625,
        321.1037292480469,
        324.6090393066406
      ],
      "text": "5.2 Tools for screening for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        333.2225036621094,
        272.2785339355469,
        351.4925231933594
      ],
      "text": "5.2.1 Computer-aided detection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.1983947753906,
        527.5926513671875,
        372.64141845703125
      ],
      "text": "Further evidence is needed about the performance of CAD software stratified according to the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.3984069824219,
        527.4012451171875,
        385.8414306640625
      ],
      "text": "characteristics of the individual being evaluated (e.g. by smear status, HIV status, age cohort, history",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.5984191894531,
        527.16015625,
        399.04144287109375
      ],
      "text": "of TB, smoking status, sex) to allow for better setting-specific and patient-specific calibration of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.7984924316406,
        156.3564910888672,
        412.24151611328125
      ],
      "text": "CAD programmes.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        419.5024108886719,
        527.4398193359375,
        433.9454345703125
      ],
      "text": "More research on users’ perspectives is needed about CAD technologies in TB screening and triage,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.702392578125,
        454.0738830566406,
        447.1454162597656
      ],
      "text": "including their perceived acceptability to patients, providers and other stakeholders.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.40631103515625,
        527.4266967773438,
        468.8493347167969
      ],
      "text": "The development and evaluation of CAD programmes for automated detection of TB in children is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.6062927246094,
        527.5853881835938,
        482.04931640625
      ],
      "text": "urgently needed, as CXR is an important tool for detecting pulmonary TB in children and adolescents,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.978328704833984,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.8063049316406,
        338.6455993652344,
        495.24932861328125
      ],
      "text": "given the difficulty of bacteriological testing and diagnosis.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        505.6729431152344,
        218.1111297607422,
        523.9429321289062
      ],
      "text": "5.2.2 C-reactive protein",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.6488037109375,
        527.5928955078125,
        545.091796875
      ],
      "text": "For people living with HIV in settings with different TB prevalences, more research is needed to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.8488159179688,
        527.3859252929688,
        558.2918090820312
      ],
      "text": "evaluate the accuracy and predictive value of measuring CRP above any cut-off higher than 5 mg/L",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        557.0489501953125,
        485.6091003417969,
        571.491943359375
      ],
      "text": "for TB screening, when it is used either alone or in combination with other screening tests.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.9154052734375,
        239.1363067626953,
        600.1853637695312
      ],
      "text": "5.2.3 Screening algorithms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.8914184570312,
        527.582275390625,
        621.3344116210938
      ],
      "text": "Across all populations and tools, more research is needed to evaluate the accuracy and effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998950004577637,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        620.0914306640625,
        527.3375244140625,
        634.534423828125
      ],
      "text": "of complete screening and diagnostic algorithms, including symptom screening, CXR, CRP and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.2913818359375,
        527.43017578125,
        647.734375
      ],
      "text": "mWRDs used in various combinations with diagnostic evaluation. Research into their effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        646.4913940429688,
        527.3814697265625,
        660.9343872070312
      ],
      "text": "should include measures of the impacts on patient-important outcomes, such as mortality and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        659.6912841796875,
        155.01010131835938,
        674.13427734375
      ],
      "text": "treatment success.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.217041015625,
        136.43409729003906,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        796.217041015625,
        170.0604705810547,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        796.217041015625,
        226.65042114257812,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis:",
